<div class="card mb-3">
  <p class="sec-hdr">Your GPUs</p>
  <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-brand-forest mb-1">Add your GPUs</h2>
  <p class="text-brand-muted text-xs mb-4">
    Pick from the list or enter your own. We'll show how many GPUs you need
    and, once you add prices, what it costs to run per million prompts.
  </p>

  <div class="mb-4">
    <label class="field-label">Pick from GPU catalog</label>
    <span class="field-sub"
      >Includes datacenter, workstation, and consumer GPUs from NVIDIA, AMD,
      and Intel. Add more than one to compare.</span
    >
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-2">
      <div class="flex-1 relative min-w-0">
        <select id="gpuCatalogSelect" class="pr-9 w-full">
          <option value="">— Choose a GPU to add —</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <button
        class="btn-primary"
        style="padding:11px 18px;white-space:nowrap;"
        data-action="addFromCatalog">+ Add</button
      >
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
    <div class="flex-1 h-px bg-brand-forest/10"></div>
    <span
      class="text-brand-muted text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest"
      >or add your own GPU</span
    >
    <div class="flex-1 h-px bg-brand-forest/10"></div>
  </div>
  <button class="btn-sm mb-4" data-action="addGpuRow"
    >+ Add a GPU manually</button
  >

  <div id="gpuTableWrap" class="hidden gpu-table-container">
    <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-2">
      <table id="gpuTable">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th style="min-width:200px">GPU name</th>
            <th style="min-width:110px">Memory per GPU (GB)</th>
            <th style="min-width:160px"
              >Price per GPU <span class="optional-pill">optional</span></th
            >
            <th style="min-width:160px"
              >Yearly opex per GPU <span class="optional-pill"
                >optional</span
              ></th
            >
            <th style="width:36px"></th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody id="gpuBody"></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="note">
      Yearly opex = power + space + upkeep for each GPU. Add price and opex
      to see your cost per prompt.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
